ork City.\n\nTitle: April 1928\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/April_1928\nExcerpt: The following events occurred in April 1928:\n\nTitle: December 1974\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_1974\nExcerpt: The following events occurred in December 1974:"
